meta {
  name: Delete binder
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/binders/4
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  If-Match: {{binderEtag}}
}

docs {
  Deleting a binder cascades to its cards and certificates.
  Seed data has binders 1-3; run "Create binder" first to have a binder 4,
  then "Get binder" (adjust the id) to capture its ETag.
  The If-Match header is required (428 without it, 412 when stale).
}
